#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Few huge bullets, each with lots of damage."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Bullet Storm"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Lots of bullets, big magazine, high fire rate and fast reload."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Marksman"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Hitting from far away and behind walls."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Control"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Hinder the enemy: slowed, blinded, poisoned, pushed."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Poison"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Apply and spread Poison, which stacks with every hit."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Burn"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Apply Burn, which deals a lot per second and doesn't stack."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Freeze"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Apply frost stacks until the target freezes, then break the ice."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Affliction"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Improve every effect that stays on the enemy: last longer, mark, burst, prevent healing."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Reflect enemy bullets with the shield."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Offensive Shield"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "The shield as a weapon, up close."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Close Quarters"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Get right up to the enemy and hit."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Tank"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Health, healing and armor."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Aerial"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Stay up high: jumps, walls, gliding."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Dash"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Dash more often, farther and with effects."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "All or Nothing"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Trade health for power."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Mosquito"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Small body and low health: fire rate, poison and healing to make up for it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Damage"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How much health each bullet takes away (25 on the base weapon). Every Damage bonus adds into a single one, including momentary ones (Fury, Executioner, Cold Blood...): +45% and +30% = +75%. A card that multiplies damage says so, like Lucky's critical and Last Bullet."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Fire rate"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How many shots per second. Fire rate +40% = 40% more shots in the same time; Fire rate x3 = triple."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Bullet speed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How fast the bullet flies to the target. Faster arrives sooner and is easier to land from far away."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Bullet drop"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How much the bullet falls during flight. -50% falls half as much; x2 falls twice as much."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How far the bullet goes: it vanishes once it is farther than this, in a straight line, from where the shot came out (bounces count while they stay inside; the Boomerang bullet turns 3 m before the end and comes back). Without Range losses on your cards there is no limit. Losses multiply and stop at 12 m; gains apply to what is left."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Bullet size"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "The size of the bullet: bigger is easier to land. It also grows a little with damage. Losses stop at 60% of normal."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Magazine"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How many shots you fire before you need to reload."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Reload"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "The time to fill the magazine again (reload key or empty magazine)."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Cooldown"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "The wait before you can use the shield, the dash or the master card again."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Movement speed"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How fast you walk and run."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Health"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Max health. Your body grows a little with it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "An effect that stays on the enemy for a while: Poison, Burn, Freeze, Slow, Blind, Dizzy and Shield locked. Tenacity shortens all of them; Armored reduces none."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Slow, long damage: 5 s. Stacks: each hit adds a new poison. Of the bullet damage above 40, it yields only 2/3."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Fast, short damage: a lot per second, for a short time. Doesn't stack: a new hit refreshes the time and the strongest one counts. Of the bullet damage above 40, it yields only 70%."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Frost stacks, up to 5: each one makes the target's fire rate and reload 6% slower. At the 5th, they freeze for 0.5 s (can't act, but take damage) and the stacks reset; then they can't freeze again for 3 s. After 2 s without a new stack, they lose one per second."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Breaking the ice"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "The first hit on someone frozen deals +20 and ends the ice. Poison and burn don't break it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Once-per-hit effects"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Frost stacks, Ember heat-up and Pressure apply at most once every 0.25 s from each shooter on each target: several bullets from the same shot (shotgun) count once."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Slow"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "The target moves slower. Doesn't stack: the strongest one counts."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "How cards add up"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Upgrades to the same attribute add up (+20% and +20% = +40%). Downgrades multiply and have a limit: in general, no attribute drops below 35% of normal."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "a bit of every group"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "weapon and bullets"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Bulwark"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "close-range shield: defend, close in and hit"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Acrobat"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "movement and mobility"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Chaos"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "only the craziest cards"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Random"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "randomly drawn"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "Empty"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/autoload/card_db.gd
msgid "you choose everything"
msgstr ""

